@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可是话说回来，<br>这次的案情<br>只涉及到我和希罗<br>两个人。|#0202Trial05_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

