@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……艾玛说得对。|#0202Trial05_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Arms3,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:尸体<br>是在我经过中庭以后<br>才被发现的。|#0202Trial05_Hiro002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal2,ArmR6,ArmL3,Eyes2_Angry_Open1,Mouth2_Determined_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:所以我才说<br>艾玛是凶手。<br>……前提是<br>我经过中庭时确实没看漏尸体。|#0202Trial05_Hiro003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

