@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:咦？<br>那就是说<br>也有可能是希罗你<br>没注意到尸体？|#0202Trial05_Noah001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR4,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:希罗，<br>你在直播中<br>看到可可死了<br>就过来<br>找她了对吧。|#0202Trial05_Noah002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL2,
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:所以你<br>找人找得<br>很匆忙……|#0202Trial05_Noah003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Noah.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Noah Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"就算经过中庭时<br>没注意到尸体<br>也<link=\"Objection_02_02_05_01\">并不出奇</link>吧～？<br>|#0202Trial05_Noah004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

