@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不过，<br>比起质疑希罗的所见，<br>我觉得还有<br>其他问题更值得讨论。|#0202Trial05_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

