@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:希罗，你刚才说<br>可可的死亡地点<br>很有可能是<br>地下的焚烧炉室，<br>对吧。|#0202Trial05_Leia003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR8,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
