@PrintDebateText Text:如果是谁<br>把尸体从地下<br>搬运到了中庭……|#0202Trial05_Miria002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR8,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Lifeless01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Sweat>Sweat01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
